<title>POLAND: Poland sets WKSM minimum price at PLN 26.</title>
<headline>Poland sets WKSM minimum price at PLN 26.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   granite and gravel quarrier</p>
<p>					     Wroclawskie Kopalnie</p>
<p>					     Surowcow Mineralnych SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Minimum price:			  26*</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 213,550</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		403,000</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   BRE brokerage</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			change the firm's</p>
<p>					     shareholder structure, build</p>
<p>					     processing plant</p>
<p>* Note: Employee tranche of new shares to be sold at static price of 26 zlotys.</p>
<p> Tranches			  No of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>				     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> state treasury shares	 132,950		  June 2-6</p>
<p>employee tranche</p>
<p>     (new shares)		 80,600		  June 2-6</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p>State Treasury - 53 pct of shares</p>
<p>Bank Zachodni SA - 35.5 pct of shares</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
